# IDEA GACHA — AI provider configuration
#
# Leave VITE_ANTHROPIC_API_KEY empty/unset to run in DEMO MODE:
# the app works fully (gacha, animation, scores, save) using
# pre-written sample ideas instead of calling a real AI.
#
# To connect a real AI, copy this file to `.env` and fill in a key.
# NOTE: this MVP calls the Anthropic API directly from the browser
# for simplicity. Do not use a production API key this way — for a
# real deployment, proxy requests through a backend so the key never
# reaches client code.

VITE_ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
VITE_ANTHROPIC_MODEL=claude-sonnet-4-5
